  "question": {
    "text": "The electric field on two sides of a large charged plate is shown in the diagram. The charge density on the plate in S.I. units is given by (<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>ε</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is the permittivity of free space in S.I. units)<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0024_a9944b678fad.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 158px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mi>&epsilon;</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>",
